 this  thing even more complicated by just  adding more and more candidates  uh specifying maybe uh maybe a greater  length possible values of hyper  parameters that i wanted to tune over  but at the end of the day sometimes  regardless of what your  intended outcome is a simpler and more  parsimonious model  may be better so i'm gonna leave you  there  hopefully you've enjoyed this series on  tidy models  hopefully you've gotten something out of  it and you know how to use these  packages to tackle the next machine  learning problem that you work on  so if you enjoyed this video please  consider sharing it  smash the like button also leave me a  comment down below and let me know do  you like carrot more  do you like tidy models more uh which  one's easier  just just start a discussion down in the  comments down below  then i'll see you all in the not so  distant future until then  richard on data
 

